---
title: Implemented Forge cook and atomic publication
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Author
    participant C as game-assets cook.py
    participant V as Level and sprite validators
    participant E as Illustrated exporter
    participant G as Prepared generation
    participant O as Output symlink
    A->>C: Cook explicit inputs
    C->>V: Validate sources
    alt Invalid data
        V-->>C: Rejection
        C-->>A: Stop before publication
    else Valid data
        C->>C: Compare fingerprints
        C->>E: Reuse or export atlas
        E-->>C: Atlas metadata and PNG
        C->>G: Canonical levels and manifest
        C->>C: Verify complete generation
        C->>O: Swap output symlink
        O-->>A: Active cooked generation
    end
    Note over C,O: ui-build copies one resolved generation.<br/>Clean and incremental tests use the same rendering toolchain.
